WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.120
Another thing that Dr. Bright is not allowed to&nbsp;
do at the Foundation: No dressing up the Eye-Pods!

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:10.160
SCP-131-A and SCP-131-B are adorable, friendly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.640
and very tolerant of nonsense. But that&nbsp;
doesn't mean that it's ok to dress them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.040
up in little outfits. They don't like&nbsp;
it, and it's frankly undignified.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.400
They don't need Halloween costumes, bow ties,&nbsp;
little cowboy hats (or hats of any kind),&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.640
monocles, or any other clothing. Leave them alone.

